1
00:00:00,220 --> 00:00:02,310
Did you ignore
your check-engine light?

2
00:00:02,473 --> 00:00:04,553
(Penny:)No, Mr. Smarty-pants.

3
00:00:04,725 --> 00:00:06,765
I ignored the fill-gas-tank light.

4
00:00:07,895 --> 00:00:10,985
(Sheldon:)Leonard, Penny wants to exploit
any feelings you have for her...

5
00:00:11,148 --> 00:00:12,898
(Sheldon:)...in order to get a ride to work.

6
00:00:13,066 --> 00:00:15,156
Oh, uh, sure, let me just put this
in a travel mug.

7
00:00:16,028 --> 00:00:18,028
-Hello?
-Hi.

8
00:00:18,238 --> 00:00:23,238
(Penny:)Oh, Penny, this is Dr. Plimpton,
a leading expert on quantum cosmology.

9
00:00:23,452 --> 00:00:26,292
(Penny:)Dr. Plimpton, Penny is a waitress
who doesn't understand...

10
00:00:26,455 --> 00:00:29,415
(Penny:)...the role gasoline plays
in the internal combustion engine.

11
00:00:30,417 --> 00:00:32,377
(Leonard:)-Nice to meet you.
-Nice to meet you too.

12
00:00:32,544 --> 00:00:36,214
(Penny:)-Are you enjoying your stay?
-Yes, very much.

13
00:00:38,550 --> 00:00:40,680
(Sheldon:)Good.

14
00:00:41,053 --> 00:00:43,383
(Sheldon:)Wonderful. Meaningless
pleasantries accomplished.

15
00:00:43,555 --> 00:00:45,935
(Sheldon:)Elizabeth, Leonard's bathroom time
is coming up...

16
00:00:46,099 --> 00:00:48,889
(Sheldon:)...and, believe me,
you do not want to follow him.

17
00:00:49,394 --> 00:00:51,144
(Sheldon:)Excuse me.

18
00:00:52,147 --> 00:00:55,607
(Leonard:)Okay, well, I guess I should get dressed
so I can take everyone to work.

19
00:00:55,776 --> 00:00:59,276
(Leonard:)You and Sheldon and Sheldon's friend,
Dr. Plimpton, who you just met.

